  "description": "The family crumbled like a sand castle in the blink of an eye after their father’s suicide. I became the head of the family and had to take responsibility for my mother who lost her mind and my blind little sister who goes to a special school. For the sake of my family, I’m going to start my own gang at the strongest gang school in Busan. Hot action for a cold world.\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[KakaoPage](https://page.kakao.com/home/51131452), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=10404027)\n\n**Official Translations:**  \n[French](https://www.lezhinfr.com/detail/daf_0000348), [Japanese](https://jp.piccoma.com/web/product/6793)",
